lor you're  definitely encouraged to attend so you  don't necessarily have to be a teacher  but you can be a coach a barber a  counselor and what have you and register  for that conference which is today and  tomorrow  reporting live from martin luther king  boulevard in kerry avenue bianca holman  8 news now thank you very much bianca  very important program
 

